{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' __issue_context__.json\"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"body\": \"**Preferred gene-related syndrome label**\\nHyperinsulinemic hypoglycemia, familial 3\\n\\n**Synonyms**\\nGCK-related hyperinsulinism\\n\\n**Parent term (use [OLS](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols/ontologies/mondo), or your favorite ontology browser)**\\nhttps://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/mondo/classes/http%253A%252F%252Fpurl.obolibrary.org%252Fobo%252FMONDO_0017182 MONDO:0017182 familial hyperinsulinism\\n\\n**Definition**\\nFamilial hyperinsulinemic hypoglycemia 3 (FHH3) is an autosomal dominant form of congenital hyperinsulinism due to gain-of-function mutations in glucokinase (GCK), which lower the glucose threshold for insulin secretion. \\n\\n\\n**Definition source (Please give PubMed ID, if applicable, in format PMID:#######)\\nPMIDs: 15277402, 34680961,24890200\\n\\n**Children terms (if applicable)** Should any existing terms be re-classified as children underneath this new proposed term? \\nN/A\\n\\n**Your nano-attribution (ORCID) or URL for a working group**\\n(https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40016/)\\n\\n\",\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach872DAJL\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"elmacke\"\n      },\n      \"authorAssociation\": \"NONE\",\n      \"body\": \"Hello, our GCEP is wondering when this request might be completed?\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-25T16:25:37Z\",\n      \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n      \"isMinimized\": false,\n      \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n      \"reactionGroups\": [],\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9861#issuecomment-4127982155\",\n      \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach873vaac\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"MeeSiing\"\n      },\n      \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n      \"body\": \"@elmacke, thank you for submitting the ticket and your patience. \\n\\nThere is an existing Mondo term MONDO:0011236 'hyperinsulinemic hypoglycemia due to glucokinase deficiency' that has the same concept and gene association as the request term. Based on OMIM's update and your request, MONDO:0011236 has been updated to be 'hyperinsulinemic hypoglycemia, familial, 3'. 'GCK-related hyperinsulinism' has been added as synonym.\\n\\nA PR has been created for the changes and it will be reviewed soon. \\n\\nThanks.\\n\\n\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-30T16:29:02Z\",\n      \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n      \"isMinimized\": false,\n      \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n      \"reactionGroups\": [],\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9861#issuecomment-4156401308\",\n      \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach873zOL8\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"MeeSiing\"\n      },\n      \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n      \"body\": \"@elmacke, the PR is been reviewed and we need some additional information. \\n\\nCan you please take a look at https://omim.org/entry/602485 and confirm if this term has exactly the same concept as the request term, or are you looking for a more specific term to associate with 'gain-of-function mutations' mentioned in the definition?\\n\\nThanks. \",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-30T18:56:11Z\",\n      \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n      \"isMinimized\": false,\n      \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n      \"reactionGroups\": [],\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9861#issuecomment-4157399804\",\n      \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach874m7Fd\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"tpollin\"\n      },\n      \"authorAssociation\": \"NONE\",\n      \"body\": \"@elmacke  @MeeSiing  this is the same concept but we would prefer the term GCK-related hyperinsulinism as the primary term in keeping with updated recommended nomenclature (Toni Pollin, Co-Chair, ClinGen Monogenic Diabetes Gene Curation Expert Panel)\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-01T15:35:58Z\",\n      \"includesCreatedEdit\": true,\n      \"isMinimized\": false,\n      \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n      \"reactionGroups\": [],\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9861#issuecomment-4170953053\",\n      \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"title\": \"[NTR/gene]\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9861\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
