x seizures.\" [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40060/, PMID:40210679, PMID:40442284]\nsubset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028178\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsubset: omim {source=\"OMIM:621304\"}\nsubset: rare\nsynonym: \"DEE119\" EXACT ABBREVIATION [OMIM:621304]\nsynonym: \"developmental and epileptic encephalopathy 119\" EXACT [OMIM:621304]\nsynonym: \"RNU2-2 developmental and epileptic encephalopathy\" EXACT [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40060/] {OMO:0002001=\"https://w3id.org/information-resource-registry/clingen\"}\nsynonym: \"RNU2-2 syndrome\" EXACT [PMID:40210679]\nxref: GARD:0028178 {source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nxref: OMIM:621304 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\nis_a: MONDO:0100062 {source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40060/\"} ! genetic developmental and epileptic encephalopathy\nintersection_of: MONDO:0100062 ! genetic developmental and epileptic encephalopathy\nintersection_of: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/10152 ! RNU2-2\nrelationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/10152 {source=\"OMIM:621304\", source=\"PMID:40210679\", source=\"PMID:40442284\", source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40060/\"} ! RNU2-2\nproperty_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9595\" xsd:anyURI\n\n[Term]\nid: MONDO:1060179\nname: RNU5B-1 related neurodevelopmental disorder with seizures and joint laxity\ndef: \"A neurodevelopmental disorder in which the cause of the disease is a variation in RNU5B-1 gene and is characterized by global developmental delay, hypotonia, macrocephaly, failure to thrive, abnormality of the eye, seizures, and joint laxity\" [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40060/, MONDO:patterns/disease_series_by_gene, PMID:40379786, PMID:40442284]\nsubset: omim {source=\"OMIM:621302\"}\nsynonym: \"NEDSJL\" EXACT ABBREVIATION [OMIM:621302]\nsynonym: \"neurodevelopmental disorder with seizures and joint laxity\" EXACT [OMI